! Initial-letter substitutions, used only when INITIAL_EDITS in
! Makefile.mod-desktop-hfst.am is set to 'regex' or 'both'.
!
! The alphabet must match the one declared in editdist.default.txt. It
! previously carried á, č and š, which South Sámi does not use, and omitted ï,
! which it does -- so with initial edits enabled, no correction to a word
! beginning in ï was reachable while three unused letters were searched.
[
[ ? ]::0 |
[ [A|B|C|D|E|F|G|H|I|Ï|J|K|L|M|N|O|P|R|S|T|U|V|W|X|Y|Z|Ä|Æ|Ø|Ö|Å] ->
  [A|B|C|D|E|F|G|H|I|Ï|J|K|L|M|N|O|P|R|S|T|U|V|W|X|Y|Z|Ä|Æ|Ø|Ö|Å] ]::30 
|
[ [a|b|c|d|e|f|g|h|i|ï|j|k|l|m|n|o|p|r|s|t|u|v|w|x|y|z|ä|æ|ø|ö|å] ->
  [a|b|c|d|e|f|g|h|i|ï|j|k|l|m|n|o|p|r|s|t|u|v|w|x|y|z|ä|æ|ø|ö|å] ]::20 
] ;
